adocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#2-配置静态导出目录推荐-docs","content":"官方参考文档：  https://fumadocs.dev/docs/ui/static-export"},"279":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-18","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#2-配置静态导出目录推荐-docs","content":"Fumadocs/Next.js 默认静态导出目录为 out/"},"280":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-19","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#2-配置静态导出目录推荐-docs","content":"因为 github pages 的静态页面只能放在根目录或者 docs 目录，所以，这里推荐直接把 out/ 移动到 docs。后面会有统一的脚本"},"281":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-20","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#2-配置静态导出目录推荐-docs","content":"示例脚本（Linux/macOS）："},"282":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-21","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#3-给静态页面实现搜索功能","content":"官方参考文档：\nhttps://fumadocs.dev/docs/ui/search/orama#static\nhttps://fumadocs.dev/docs/headless/search/orama#static-export"},"283":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-22","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#3-给静态页面实现搜索功能","content":"修改下面的文件，把搜索变成静态的，这样就可以实现把文档静态加载到页面上，实现前端搜索"},"284":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-23","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#3-给静态页面实现搜索功能","content":"新增一个组件，包装搜索 client"},"285":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-24","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#3-给静态页面实现搜索功能","content":"替换默认的搜索框"},"286":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-25","page_id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github#3-给静态页面实现搜索功能","content":"配置完成之后，可以重新执行 bas npm run build  获得的静态页面就支持搜索了。"},"287":{"id":"/docs/others/fumadocs-github-26","page_id":"/docs/ot